      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MACK IN BOOTS (1) finds it hard to win but has a consistent overall record, having placed nine of 18 career runs. Has finished in the money at the last four runs. Has never been out of the money in four starts this course and distance. Can find winning form. ROTHWELL JACK (4) turned in a plain performance last time when seventh at Geelong over 400m behind Star Of Roxy (23.63) in a Mix 6/7. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Can do much better this time. COLLINDA RAMSAY (6) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (22.90) at Shepparton. Shapes as one to consider. DARK HABITS (3) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into third last time out (24.58) over 425m at this track.",
